        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "647ae804-904a-3102-965d-41d65abed510",
                "word": "disciplineren",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0cd401e-d191-34f2-bcc0-063328eb2d0e",
                        "entry_id": "647ae804-904a-3102-965d-41d65abed510",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zorgen dat iets of iemand zich volgens de wetten en regels gaat gedragen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a306f5f-e77b-4631-adae-9ec7ae769ce5",
                                "sense_id": "c0cd401e-d191-34f2-bcc0-063328eb2d0e",
                                "text": "Tussen 1976 en 1983, toen Videla president was van Argentinië, zijn er tot 8000 mensen gedood, geeft Videla toe in een boek van de Argentijnse journalist Ceferino Reato dat zaterdag uitkomt. De lichamen werden verborgen of vernietigd om protesten in binnen- en buitenland te voorkomen. Videla zou gezegd hebben dat 'er geen andere oplossing mogelijk was om een anarchistische maatschappij te disciplineren', en dat het regime nu eenmaal een grote hoeveelheid mensen moest uitschakelen, zonder dat de rest van het land daar notie van kreeg."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3a90c4b-7317-4343-ab5f-3fd57d77a86e",
                                "sense_id": "c0cd401e-d191-34f2-bcc0-063328eb2d0e",
                                "text": "De waarde van geld werd tot 1971 een-op-een gedekt door baren goud in de kluizen van de overheid of de centrale banken. Hardcore Republikeinen willen met de goudstandaard de Amerikaanse overheid disciplineren: niet langer kan de overheid dan nog de geldpers aanzetten om tekorten snel op te vangen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80f5d3c0-8541-4c71-a459-5a6b236e9a02",
                                "sense_id": "c0cd401e-d191-34f2-bcc0-063328eb2d0e",
                                "text": "Het komt soms voor dat George geen zin heeft om te eten en dan vliegen volgens insiders de aardappels, groente en stukjes kipfilet over de eettafel. De kleine monarch doet dit, terwijl hij blafgeluiden maakt. Om hem te disciplineren moet hij de troep zelf opruimen en schoonmaken. Ook krijgt hij geen vervangende maaltijd, met als resultaat dat de prins mag kiezen: óf eten wat de pot schaft, óf met honger naar bed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d679da3e-9624-44cd-be31-e8505967bcc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "647ae804-904a-3102-965d-41d65abed510",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0cd401e-d191-34f2-bcc0-063328eb2d0e",
                        "target_lang_word": "punish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "punish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4606199a-b843-3e6b-9305-01bce076cf18",
                                        "entry_id": "21c46b40-af01-3b19-8178-3562486419f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause (a child, student, or someone else being looked after, or a suspect or criminal) to suffer for crime or misconduct, to administer disciplinary action, typically by an authority or a person in authority (for example: a parent, teacher, or police officer)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49566fce-4ff7-4b4c-9434-579abd42119b",
                                                "sense_id": "4606199a-b843-3e6b-9305-01bce076cf18",
                                                "text": "If a prince violates the law, then he must be punished like an ordinary person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59047500-8d7a-4661-8339-e834a72f18ac",
                                                "sense_id": "4606199a-b843-3e6b-9305-01bce076cf18",
                                                "text": "It was not from the want of proper laws that dangerous principles had been disseminated, and had assumed a threatening aspect, but because those laws had not been employed by the executive power to remedy the evil, and to punish the offenders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7ddd33e-1498-419d-ae52-747447297f9e",
                                                "sense_id": "4606199a-b843-3e6b-9305-01bce076cf18",
                                                "text": "The law needs to punish this behaviour as a deterrent to others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad8194cd-f87f-45a7-8347-6c224a727753",
                                                "sense_id": "4606199a-b843-3e6b-9305-01bce076cf18",
                                                "text": "But officials here maintain that their methods do make a difference, and they follow it up with post-release programs. The aim of Bastoy is not to punish or seek revenge, Nilsen said. The only punishment is to take away the prisoner’s right to be a free member of society."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53c5940a-0234-423a-a04a-25643038b927",
                                                "sense_id": "4606199a-b843-3e6b-9305-01bce076cf18",
                                                "text": "His mother had punished him when he'd deserved it. She'd loved him, he was “all she had,” but she'd punished him, too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f484424-3500-373c-a49f-bef88b18c7f5",
                                        "entry_id": "21c46b40-af01-3b19-8178-3562486419f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To treat harshly and unfairly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76e704ea-57c6-4d24-8532-2e7e5802b501",
                                                "sense_id": "0f484424-3500-373c-a49f-bef88b18c7f5",
                                                "text": "But each effort that Anna makes —and she has attempted many— meets with obstacles from a welfare bureaucracy that punishes single mothers for initiative and partial economic self-sufficiency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f3f10f2-6938-49fd-a612-9b3b5b90d8df",
                                                "sense_id": "0f484424-3500-373c-a49f-bef88b18c7f5",
                                                "text": "Homer, moreover, gives the impression that the Sun punished Odysseus's men; but we are later told that the Sun cannot punish individual men […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d562101d-5f5d-4978-9a98-e2d24dc41f0a",
                                                "sense_id": "0f484424-3500-373c-a49f-bef88b18c7f5",
                                                "text": "The rider who comes back on his horse in mid-air over a fence is punishing his horse severely."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15c195e3-89ab-367c-93c5-467264c0f69e",
                                        "entry_id": "21c46b40-af01-3b19-8178-3562486419f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To handle or beat severely; to maul."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ac649d5-b267-3c51-a510-b5d056cbee15",
                                        "entry_id": "21c46b40-af01-3b19-8178-3562486419f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To consume a large quantity of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ddc7483-abc5-4b0c-87c2-848faea601ac",
                                                "sense_id": "3ac649d5-b267-3c51-a510-b5d056cbee15",
                                                "text": "A few moments later, we were all sitting around the veranda of the hunters' dining hall, punishing the gin, as usual."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d71682fb-4347-4b10-b306-0bec30ade48e",
                        "source_entry_id": "647ae804-904a-3102-965d-41d65abed510",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0cd401e-d191-34f2-bcc0-063328eb2d0e",
                        "target_lang_word": "discipline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "discipline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e129217-4275-32cc-9536-bb55d9776b77",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d4c84ff-82b2-405d-9a53-4148efc0f8ae",
                                                "sense_id": "9e129217-4275-32cc-9536-bb55d9776b77",
                                                "text": "The most perfect, who have their passions in the best discipline, are yet obliged to be constantly on their guard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e910023-0a81-380e-9cdc-d90c1abdb48c",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "An enforced compliance or control."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81f46e03-db39-4585-8a91-276a516b146f",
                                                "sense_id": "7e910023-0a81-380e-9cdc-d90c1abdb48c",
                                                "text": "The masters looked unusually stern, but it was the sternness of thought rather than of discipline."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30530965-bb7d-330c-9184-c10e003e93f7",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "A systematic method of obtaining obedience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40350807-37ea-4466-8cdc-75c80234df42",
                                                "sense_id": "30530965-bb7d-330c-9184-c10e003e93f7",
                                                "text": "Discipline aims at the removal of bad habits and the substitution of good ones, especially those of order, regularity, and obedience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ced446-6ced-4399-8922-406ba3ea85c3",
                                                "sense_id": "30530965-bb7d-330c-9184-c10e003e93f7",
                                                "text": "Endure hardship as discipline; God is treating you as his children. For what children are not disciplined by their father?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcd810c2-6ea9-3a98-9d90-e263624eb8aa",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "A state of order based on submission to authority."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e709fb9-5b6a-45ab-b102-6fc926053f0b",
                                                "sense_id": "bcd810c2-6ea9-3a98-9d90-e263624eb8aa",
                                                "text": "Their wildness lose, and, quitting nature's part, / Obey the rules and discipline of art."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "023b4fc7-0942-36a3-bb52-4ba35f27dd30",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "A set of rules regulating behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84f63cae-21f8-3879-8e9e-ab82c0cf8b34",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "A punishment to train or maintain control."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "982f4440-de50-4dbc-9508-548ee032c28a",
                                                "sense_id": "84f63cae-21f8-3879-8e9e-ab82c0cf8b34",
                                                "text": "giving her the discipline of the strap"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8f6cdf1-1f9a-3c37-94a8-4c5b80163c61",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "A punishment to train or maintain control.",
                                            "A whip used for self-flagellation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e94e238f-a316-40bd-bdbd-b764b76c47fa",
                                                "sense_id": "d8f6cdf1-1f9a-3c37-94a8-4c5b80163c61",
                                                "text": "All she had done was give Teena a cilice, a barbed metal chain she was to tie around her thigh for two hours every day, and a discipline, a rope whip with knotted ends she was to use on her back when she prayed the Hail Mary."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "080782da-b7dc-3d17-9d79-6fc46f15d7eb",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlled behaviour; self-control.",
                                            "A punishment to train or maintain control.",
                                            "A flagellation as a means of obtaining sexual gratification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ae64cc0-5575-39e0-a357-b1607ac8632f",
                                        "entry_id": "3d8c689f-5767-3ce0-92ce-43b47f0cad40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A specific branch of knowledge, learning, or practice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38f22948-1653-4791-8c57-568898638715",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae64cc0-5575-39e0-a357-b1607ac8632f",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: specialty, speciality"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f520353b-77fc-4dd1-bdbe-24cf83efe049",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae64cc0-5575-39e0-a357-b1607ac8632f",
                                                "text": "academic disciplines"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "355eaa20-b3f7-4192-8113-a48b666c93a6",
